  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;in the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
